{
  // The editor's own question, asked outside the editor.
  //
  // The `types` gate in `flet-box verify` runs this exact file (switching to
  // `tsconfig.json` only when one exists), with the `typescript` package the
  // editor brings — so what the editor underlines and what the gate reports
  // are the same diagnostics, not two implementations of the same question.
  //
  // Scope, and why:
  //   - `bin/` and `scripts/` are the CLI and the gates: TypeScript, Node 20
  //     and the DOM. `@types/node` (a devDependency, never shipped) gives
  //     the `process`/`Buffer`/fs names an editor would otherwise underline.
  //   - `src/` is the framework's runtime, written for the browser and
  //     exercised through the apps' own jsconfig (which generated projects
  //     carry) — re-checking it here with `checkJs: false` would take it
  //     through the same compiler with... no. `src/` is in, with checkJs
  //     OFF, so the gate still resolves every import of the shipped package
  //     and catches a broken one — while the app-side contract (the props
  //     table vs `index.d.ts`) stays where it is owned: `check-app-types`.
  //
  // `checkJs` is deliberately off for the repository-wide run: the CLI's
  // module boundaries are carried by JSDoc `@param {object}` types that the
  // compiler reads as `object` and then (correctly) refuses to destructure.
  // Sequencing ~390 such annotations across every command is a separate,
  // mechanical, reviewable pass — it is not this change. Until it lands, the
  // strict half of the check is pinned on the lint/format code, which is new
  // and JSDoc-complete: `scripts/check-types.mjs` runs tsc with checkJs true
  // over those files and requires zero diagnostics.
  "compilerOptions": {
    "allowJs": true,
    "checkJs": false,
    "noEmit": true,
    "module": "esnext",
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "target": "es2022",
    "lib": ["es2022", "dom", "dom.iterable"],
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "strict": false,
    "noImplicitAny": false,
    "noUnusedLocals": false,
    "noUnusedParameters": false,
    "types": ["node"]
  },
  "include": ["bin", "scripts", "src"]
}
